{"base":"96251f128e2d0f5f58f05d5064672b37474ef409","description":"Add interactive mode to attest and redact\n\n- Make commit/cid optional in Attest and Redact structs\n- Make reason optional in Redact; prompt when omitted at a terminal\n- Extract prompt module from share feature gate so interactive\n  picker is available without the share feature\n- Move inquire to a non-optional dependency\n- Return String errors from pick_interactive to decouple from\n  error::Share; callers map to their own error types\n\nWithout arguments at a terminal, both commands now present the\nsame release/artifact picker as fetch rather than requiring all\nargs to be spelled out on the command line.\n\n\nFix attest/redact failing for non-delegates\n\n- Use find_unique_by_oid instead of find_delegate_release\n- Drop unused delegates param from attest_artifact and redact_artifact\n- The COB state machine already enforces per-signer ownership,\n  so a delegate filter was wrong here too\n\n\nFix redacted/attested row over-indentation\n\n- Move redacted/attestations rows from col3 to col2\n- Avoids large gap when artifact has no locations","oid":"76e7cfa1c4375e76bb50a97b9e1fcaad3d2e3627","type":"revision"}